  "description": "Snaxons – Fat Cap Graffiti Font for Street, Hip Hop & Urban Branding\nSnaxons is a bold fat cap graffiti display font featuring oversized rounded strokes, authentic spray-paint inspiration, and expressive urban letterforms. Designed to capture the energy of street culture, it delivers a powerful visual impact that stands out across branding, entertainment, and promotional designs.\nPerfect for streetwear brands, graffiti-inspired logos, hip hop album covers, esports graphics, event posters, skateboard graphics, stickers, merchandise, social media content, and bold advertising campaigns. Take your designs to the streets with Snaxons—a bold graffiti typeface built to make every headline loud, fearless, and unforgettable.\nTypia Nesia Studio",
